      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2010 Wiley-Liss, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "We report the first case of coil embolization using the \"modified neck remodeling technique\" in the management of a splenic artery aneurysm. This technique was feasible due to the unique and complex anatomy of the aneurysm. This condition has been largely treated by vascular surgeons and interventional radiologists; however, this patient was referred to the interventional cardiologists for endovascular coiling."
      },
